EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Dear {!Contact.FirstName} {!Contact.LastName},

Thank you for your email to the ASU Graduate Format Office. This is an automated email to acknowledge that your email has been received and to let you know that a personal response will occur in the order in which your email was received. If you are seeking format review, please expect a response within 3-5 business days.

IMPORTANT: If you are a student planning to graduate in the current semester, please visit our website for important graduation deadlines:
https://graduate.asu.edu/index.php?q=completing-your-degree

ASU Graduate Format Office

If you have any additional information to add to this case, please reply to this email.

Case Number: {!Case.CaseNumber}
Subject: {!Case.Subject}




{!Case.Thread_Id}
